const PRIVACY = "This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use the Hisense TV mobile application (“App”).\n\nThe App is operated by: VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o.\n\n## About the App\n\nThe App is a remote-control and media-casting companion for compatible Hisense televisions.\n\nIt allows users to discover compatible televisions on the same Wi-Fi network, control television functions, navigate television menus, use playback controls, access supported shortcuts, and cast selected personal media to a television.\n\nThe App does not require creation of a user account or login.\n\n## Hisense Brand Authorization\n\nThe HISENSE name and related trademarks are the property of Hisense Co., Ltd. and/or their respective rights holders.\n\nVIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. uses the HISENSE name in connection with the App under written brand and trademark authorization.\n\nVIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. operates the App and is responsible for the privacy practices described in this Privacy Policy.\n\n## No Developer Backend\n\nThe App does not operate a VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. backend for storing television, local-network, or personal media data.\n\nInformation used by the App for television discovery, connection, remote-control functionality, and related local features is processed on your device or through communication with the television over the local network.\n\nWhere the App stores technical information necessary for these functions, that information is stored locally on your device.\n\n## Local Network Access\n\nThe App requires access to your local network in order to discover and communicate with compatible televisions.\n\nWhen you use these features, the App may process technical information necessary for local television communication, which may include:\n\n- local network addresses;\n- television name or device name;\n- television model or similar device information;\n- connection or pairing information;\n- connection status;\n- other technical information required to establish and maintain communication with the television.\n\nThis information is used for purposes such as:\n\n- discovering compatible televisions;\n- establishing and maintaining a connection;\n- displaying available televisions;\n- sending remote-control commands;\n- enabling media casting.\n\nThis information is not sent to a VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. backend.\n\n## Wi-Fi Information\n\nThe App may use Wi-Fi-related information where necessary to determine local network availability and support discovery or communication with televisions connected to the same network.\n\nWi-Fi and local-network information used for these purposes is processed as part of the App’s local connectivity functionality.\n\n## Photos, Videos, and Files\n\nThe App allows you to select photos, videos, and compatible media stored on your device or available through Files and cast that media to a compatible television.\n\nWhen you choose media for casting, the App processes the selected content as necessary to perform the casting function.\n\nSelected media may be transmitted from your device to the television over your local network.\n\nThe App does not upload your selected photos, videos, or Files media to a VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. backend.\n\nThe App does not use your personal media for advertising or analytics.\n\n## Purchases and Subscriptions\n\nThe App may offer paid features through Apple in-app purchases or subscriptions.\n\nPayments are processed by Apple through the App Store.\n\nThe App uses Apphud to support subscription management and determine access to paid functionality.\n\nFor this purpose, Apphud may process limited purchase and subscription-related information necessary to manage subscription status and entitlements, such as transaction, product, subscription, or entitlement information provided through the App Store purchase process.\n\nVIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. does not directly receive or process your full payment card information.\n\nApple and Apphud process information according to their respective privacy practices and applicable agreements.\n\n## No Accounts\n\nThe App does not require you to create an account with VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o.\n\nWe do not require you to provide a name, email address, password, telephone number, or profile information in order to use the core remote-control functionality.\n\n## No Advertising\n\nThe App does not display third-party advertising.\n\nVIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. does not use information processed through the App for targeted advertising.\n\n## No Analytics\n\nThe App does not use analytics services to monitor or profile your use of the App.\n\nWe do not use Firebase Analytics, AppsFlyer, Mixpanel, or similar analytics platforms in the App.\n\n## No Firebase or Crash Reporting\n\nThe App does not use Firebase services.\n\nThe App does not use a third-party crash-reporting service to collect diagnostic crash information.\n\n## Information Stored Locally\n\nCertain information may be stored locally on your device where necessary for App functionality.\n\nThis may include technical or preference information related to television connections, previously discovered devices, pairing, or App settings.\n\nLocally stored information remains on the device unless it is transmitted directly to the television as part of a feature you request or otherwise processed as described in this Privacy Policy.\n\nRemoving the App may remove some or all locally stored App information, subject to the behavior of iOS and system storage.\n\n## Support Communications\n\nIf you contact us by email for customer support, we receive the information you voluntarily provide.\n\nThis may include:\n\n- your email address;\n- the content of your message;\n- screenshots or files you choose to attach;\n- technical details you choose to provide.\n\nWe use this information to respond to your request and resolve support issues.\n\nSupport information is separate from the App’s local television-control functionality.\n\n## How We Use Information\n\nInformation processed in connection with the App is used only as necessary to:\n\n- discover and connect to compatible televisions;\n- provide remote-control functions;\n- provide touchpad and playback controls;\n- send selected media to a television;\n- manage paid functionality and subscriptions;\n- provide customer support;\n- maintain the security and functionality of the App;\n- comply with applicable legal obligations.\n\n## Sharing of Information\n\nVIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. does not sell your personal information.\n\nInformation may be processed or shared only where necessary for the functions described in this Privacy Policy, including with:\n\n### Apple\n\nApple provides the App Store, in-app purchase, subscription, and related platform services.\n\n### Apphud\n\nApphud is used to support subscription status and entitlement management.\n\n### Your Television\n\nTechnical commands and media selected for casting may be transmitted directly to the compatible television over your local network in order to perform the function you request.\n\n### Legal Requirements\n\nInformation may be disclosed where required by applicable law, court order, legal process, or a valid request from a competent authority.\n\n## Data Retention\n\nTelevision and local-network information stored by the App is retained locally only for as long as needed for App functionality or until it is removed through normal App or device behavior.\n\nSelected media is processed as necessary to perform the casting function and is not stored on a VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. backend.\n\nPurchase and subscription information processed through Apple and Apphud may be retained in accordance with their respective service requirements and legal obligations.\n\nSupport communications may be retained for as long as reasonably necessary to resolve your request and maintain appropriate business records.\n\n## Your Privacy Rights\n\nDepending on your jurisdiction, applicable law may provide rights regarding personal information, including rights to request access, correction, deletion, restriction, objection, or portability.\n\nBecause the App does not require an account and most App functionality is performed locally, VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. may hold little or no information that directly identifies you.\n\nFor privacy-related requests, contact us at:\ntomislav@vikskendapa.store\n\n## Children’s Privacy\n\nThe App is not designed to collect personal information from children for advertising, profiling, or account creation.\n\nThe core television-control functions do not require a user account.\n\nIf we become aware that personal information has been processed in violation of applicable children’s privacy laws, we will take appropriate steps to address the issue.\n\n## Security\n\nWe use reasonable measures appropriate to the nature of the information processed through the App.\n\nHowever, no device, network, or electronic communication method can be guaranteed to be completely secure.\n\nYou are responsible for maintaining the security of your device, Wi-Fi network, and television.\n\n## Third-Party Platforms and Devices\n\nThe App interacts with Apple platforms and compatible Hisense televisions.\n\nApple, Apphud, television software, and any third-party applications accessible through the television may process information independently under their own privacy policies.\n\nThis Privacy Policy applies only to information processing for which VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. is responsible.\n\n## Changes to This Privacy Policy\n\nWe may update this Privacy Policy when the App, applicable law, platform requirements, or our information-handling practices change.\n\nThe effective date displayed at the top of this Privacy Policy will be updated when changes are made.\n\n## Contact\n\nIf you have questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to submit a privacy request, contact:\nVIK SKENDAPA d.o.o.\nUlica Ante Starcevica 13\n10290 Zapresic\nCroatia\nEmail: tomislav@vikskendapa.store";

const TERMS = "These Terms of Use (“Terms”) govern your use of the Hisense TV mobile application (“App”).\n\nThe App is operated and distributed by: VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o.\n\nBy downloading, accessing, or using the App, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the App.\n\n## About the App\n\nThe App is a remote-control and media-casting companion for compatible Hisense televisions.\n\nDepending on your television model, software version, network configuration, and available television features, the App may allow you to:\n\n- discover compatible Hisense televisions on the same Wi-Fi network;\n- connect to and control a television;\n- control power, navigation, Home, Back, Exit, volume, channels, and mute;\n- use playback controls such as rewind, play, pause, and fast-forward;\n- navigate television menus using a touchpad;\n- access supported television app shortcuts;\n- cast selected photos, videos, and compatible media from your device or Files to the television.\n\nCertain features may not be supported by every television model or configuration.\n\n## Hisense Brand Authorization\n\nThe HISENSE name and related trademarks are the property of Hisense Co., Ltd. and/or their respective rights holders.\n\nVIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. is authorized under a written brand and trademark authorization to use the HISENSE name in connection with this App, its App Store presentation, distribution, and related materials.\n\nAll ownership rights in the HISENSE trademarks remain with their respective owner.\n\nThe App is operated and distributed by VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o.\n\n## License to Use the App\n\nSubject to these Terms, VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. grants you a limited, personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable, and revocable license to install and use the App on supported Apple devices that you own or control.\n\nYou may use the App only for lawful personal purposes.\n\nYou may not:\n\n- copy, sell, rent, sublicense, or commercially redistribute the App except where permitted by law;\n- reverse engineer, decompile, or attempt to obtain the App’s source code except where such restrictions are prohibited by applicable law;\n- interfere with the operation, security, or integrity of the App;\n- use the App to access or control a television, device, or network without authorization;\n- use the App for unlawful, fraudulent, abusive, or harmful purposes.\n\n## Local Network Access\n\nThe App uses your local network to discover and communicate with compatible televisions.\n\nYour mobile device and television generally need to be connected to the same Wi-Fi or local network for discovery, remote-control, and casting functions to operate.\n\nYou are responsible for ensuring that you have permission to access the network and control any television used with the App.\n\nNetwork restrictions, router settings, television settings, firmware versions, or other technical conditions may affect connectivity.\n\n## Television Compatibility\n\nThe App is designed to work with compatible Hisense televisions, but compatibility cannot be guaranteed for every model, region, firmware version, or television operating system.\n\nSome commands or features may be unavailable or may behave differently depending on the television.\n\nTelevision software, communication methods, or device functionality may also change over time and may affect the availability of particular App features.\n\n## Media Casting\n\nThe App may allow you to select personal photos, videos, and compatible media stored on your device or available through Files and send that media to a compatible television over the local network.\n\nYou retain all rights in the media you select.\n\nYou are responsible for ensuring that you have the necessary rights and permissions to access, display, or cast any content using the App.\n\nThe App does not grant you rights to copyrighted or otherwise protected content belonging to third parties.\n\n## Subscriptions and Purchases\n\nCertain features of the App may require a paid subscription or other in-app purchase.\n\nPurchases are offered and processed through Apple’s App Store payment system.\n\nThe App uses Apphud to support subscription and entitlement management.\n\nBefore completing a purchase, Apple displays the applicable price, subscription duration, and other purchase information.\n\nWhere an automatically renewing subscription is offered:\n\n- payment is charged through your Apple ID;\n- the subscription may renew automatically unless canceled in accordance with Apple’s subscription rules;\n- you can manage or cancel your subscription through your Apple ID subscription settings;\n- deleting the App does not automatically cancel an active subscription.\n\nWhere supported, previous purchases may be restored through the App.\n\nRefunds and billing matters are handled according to Apple’s applicable terms and policies.\n\nVIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. does not directly process your payment card information.\n\n## App Store Terms\n\nIf you obtain the App through the Apple App Store, you acknowledge that these Terms are between you and VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o., not between you and Apple Inc.\n\nYour use of the App must also comply with applicable Apple terms and App Store rules.\n\nApple is not responsible for the App or its operation except to the extent required by applicable law or Apple’s applicable terms.\n\n## Intellectual Property\n\nExcept for third-party materials and trademarks, all rights in the App, including its software, interface, design, graphics, text, and other original content, are owned by or licensed to VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o.\n\nThe HISENSE name, trademarks, logos, product names, and related brand assets remain the property of Hisense Co., Ltd. and/or their respective rights holders.\n\nOther product and service names appearing within the App may be trademarks of their respective owners.\n\nNothing in these Terms transfers ownership of any intellectual property to you.\n\n## Third-Party Products and Services\n\nThe App may interact with third-party devices, platforms, applications, or services.\n\nReferences or shortcuts to services such as television applications do not transfer ownership of those services to VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o.\n\nAvailability of third-party applications and services may vary by television, region, provider, or subscription status.\n\nVIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. is not responsible for the availability, content, operation, or policies of third-party services.\n\n## No User Account\n\nThe App does not require you to create a user account or register a profile with VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o.\n\nYour ability to use some paid functionality may depend on valid App Store purchase or subscription status.\n\n## Availability and Updates\n\nWe may update or modify the App to improve functionality, maintain compatibility, address technical issues, comply with legal requirements, or adapt to changes in television platforms.\n\nWe do not guarantee that the App or every individual feature will remain continuously available.\n\n## Disclaimer of Warranties\n\nTo the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, the App is provided on an “as is” and “as available” basis.\n\nWe do not guarantee that:\n\n- every Hisense television will be compatible;\n- television discovery will always succeed;\n- every remote command will be supported;\n- media casting will work with every file format or television;\n- the App will operate without interruption or error.\n\nNothing in these Terms limits any mandatory consumer rights that cannot legally be excluded.\n\n## Limitation of Liability\n\nTo the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, VIK SKENDAPA d.o.o. will not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or similar damages arising from the use of or inability to use the App.\n\nThis includes, where legally permitted, losses arising from network failures, television incompatibility, unavailable third-party services, unsupported media, or changes made by device or platform providers.\n\nNothing in these Terms excludes or limits liability where doing so would be prohibited by law.\n\n## Termination\n\nYou may stop using the App at any time.\n\nWe may restrict use of the App where reasonably necessary to address unlawful use, abuse, security risks, or material violations of these Terms.\n\n## Privacy\n\nYour use of the App is also subject to our Privacy Policy, which explains how information is handled in connection with the App.\n\n## Changes to These Terms\n\nWe may update these Terms from time to time to reflect changes in the App, applicable law, platform requirements, or our practices.\n\nThe effective date at the top of these Terms will be updated when changes are made.\n\n## Governing Law\n\nThese Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Croatia, without prejudice to any mandatory consumer-protection rights that may apply under the laws of your country of residence.\n\n## Contact\n\nIf you have questions regarding these Terms or the App, contact:\nVIK SKENDAPA d.o.o.\nUlica Ante Starcevica 13\n10290 Zapresic\nCroatia\nEmail: tomislav@vikskendapa.store";

